  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your astral constructs are creatures of legendary might and toughness.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Boost Construct.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Any astral construct you create is considered mythic for the purpose of interacting with other mythic creatures. It doesn’t gain any mythic abilities or powers, but is affected by mythic powers, spells, and abilities as if it were a 1st-tier mythic creature. Additionally, if the astral construct has damage reduction, its damage reduction becomes DR/epic.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-enhancement-feats#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
